  "description": "Schema of the instance document mounted at /etc/dci-config/instance. Use the asset from the exact target release or that release's dcctl config-schema. Keys match case-insensitively. infrastructure.nats and infrastructure.userManagement require nonempty hostname and nonzero port; other omitted fields may take startup defaults. Declared retired keys are ignored with a warning. Static enums and bounds are checked here; startup additionally enforces cross-field, credential and environment constraints. Datastore configuration maps remain open because their keys depend on the selected driver. Integer token limitation: JSON Schema treats 4222.0 and 4.222e3 as integers, but encoding/json rejects these spellings for Go integer fields. Emit integer tokens without a decimal point or exponent.",
